## Compatibility

V1 validators accept only `schema_version: 1`. Additive or breaking machine-field changes require a new schema version, updated examples, helper validation, focused valid and invalid fixtures, and explicit migration policy. Never reinterpret a persisted v1 field silently. Human-readable wording may change only when deterministic rendering and snapshots change together.

